#: madeit-inpost.php
msgid "An InPost parcel locker shipping method for WooCommerce with a map to choose the pickup point at checkout."
msgstr "Metoda wysyłki do paczkomatu InPost dla WooCommerce z mapą do wyboru punktu odbioru w checkoucie."

